# ========================================================
# Archivo de parametros para pset 'psfexp.par'
# nombre,tipo,modo,valor_default,min,max,prompt
# PRE-PSFEX.sex es configurable internamente
key_run,s,h,"psfex",,,     the keyword to run PSFEx in shell
dthresh,r,h,4.0,0.5,INDEF, DETECT_THRESH   (in sigmas)
athresh,r,h,4.0,0.5,INDEF, ANALYSIS_THRESH (in sigmas)
defaultf,b,h,n,,,          enter 'no' if you don't have star sample!
same_img,b,h,y,,,          same image to extract stars (y/n)?
img_name,s,h,"sameimg",,,  the same data image to extract PSF
mode,s,h,al
# ========================================================
#
# --------------------------------------------------------
# VARIABLES (las siguientes lineas siempre comentadas):
# psfexp.key_run
# psfexp.dthresh
# psfexp.athresh
# psfexp.defaultf
# psfexp.same_img
# psfexp.img_name
#
